    <body>
      <div type="work" n="31">
        <pb n="71"/>
        <head>31 — vi — VII. — <quote>Rich and poor together</quote><ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a1" target="#n1" n="1"/>.</head>
        <div type="section">
          <ab n="1">Ye that are diseased and take your delight in<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a2" target="#n2" n="2"/> the hateful passions of lusts, receive the good and great <pb n="72"/> benefit of the fast [for your healing<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a3" target="#n3" n="3"/> : and ye that in asceticism are making<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a4" target="#n4" n="4"/> a struggle against invisible enemies, zealously carry this through to the uttermost like athletes, anointing [according to the gospel saying<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a5" target="#n5" n="5"/> your suprasensual head<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a6" target="#n6" n="6"/>, that is the intellect which is the guide of the soul, and moreover washing also the hidden face of your mind and spiritually adorning it : [and thus let us fitly honour the holy fast<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a7" target="#n7" n="7"/>. For a great thing for us is this<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a8" target="#n8" n="8"/> that we should fast with <persName>Christ</persName>, who on our behalf took upon him to fast<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a9" target="#n9" n="9"/> of his own will, in order that we may be admitted also to take part in his life-giving mortality, while we offer<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a10" target="#n10" n="10"/> praise to his glorious Resurrection from among the dead and to his great mercy.</ab>
        </div>
      </div>
      <noteGrp>
        <note xml:id="n1" target="#a1" n="1"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 71, n. 8</orig></choice> Ps. xlix, 3.</note>
        <note xml:id="n2" target="#a2" n="2"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 71, n. 9</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>in mind in</quote>.</note>
        <note xml:id="n3" target="#a3" n="3"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 72, n. 1</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>in healing fashion</quote>.</note>
        <note xml:id="n4" target="#a4" n="4"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 72, n. 2</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>contending in</quote>.</note>
        <note xml:id="n5" target="#a5" n="5"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 72, n. 3</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>in gospel fashion</quote>.</note>
        <note xml:id="n6" target="#a6" n="6"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 72, n. 4</orig></choice> Matth. vi, 17, 18.</note>
        <note xml:id="n7" target="#a7" n="7"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 72, n. 5</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>let us all therefore honour this (sic) as God</quote>.</note>
        <note xml:id="n8" target="#a8" n="8"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 72, n. 6</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>it</quote>.</note>
        <note xml:id="n9" target="#a9" n="9"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 72, n. 7</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>fasted</quote>.</note>
        <note xml:id="n10" target="#a10" n="10"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 72, n. 8</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>sing</quote>.</note>
      </noteGrp>
